#: ai/pantoken-ai/src/functions/scaffoldProject.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Scaffold a starter project for a platform, with pantoken already installed and wired in."
msgstr "Skap eit startprosjekt for ei plattform, med pantoken allereie installert og integrert."

#: ai/pantoken-ai/src/functions/scaffoldProject.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The target directory (default `\".\"`). Its basename (or `\"pantoken-app\"` for `\".\"`)\n  is substituted for `{{projectName}}` in the template files."
msgstr "Målmappa (standard `\".\"`). Basenamnet hennar (eller `\"pantoken-app\"` for `\".\"`)\n  blir sett inn for `{{projectName}}` i malfilene."

#: ai/pantoken-ai/src/functions/scaffoldProject.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### options?"
msgstr "### options?"

#: ai/pantoken-ai/src/functions/scaffoldProject.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`theme`/`mode` select which `@pantoken/css` token sheet scaffolded files\n  import (default `\"rebrand\"`/`\"light\"`), applied across every platform. `cdn` selects the CDN\n  provider `canvas-theme-editor`'s `theme.css`/`theme.js` are built for (default jsDelivr);\n  ignored by every other platform."
msgstr "`theme`/`mode` vel kva for `@pantoken/css` tokenark dei skaffolda filene importerer (standard `\"rebrand\"`/`\"light\"`), brukt på tvers av alle plattformer. `cdn` vel CDN-leverandøren `canvas-theme-editor` som `theme.css`/`theme.js` blir bygd for (standard jsDelivr);\n  ignorerast av alle andre plattformer."

