msgstr "**Skap eit React-startprosjekt**"

#: ai/pantoken-ai/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# pantoken-ai"
msgstr "# pantoken-ai"

#: ai/pantoken-ai/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@pantoken/ai` — consumer-facing agent assets for projects that *use* pantoken (not for\ndeveloping pantoken itself)."
msgstr "`@pantoken/ai` — forbrukar-retta agent-ressursar for prosjekt som *bruker* pantoken (ikkje for\nå utvikle pantoken sjølv)."

#: ai/pantoken-ai/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "It ships an `AGENTS.md`, an `llms.txt`, editor/agent rule files (Cursor, Copilot, Windsurf), and\nClaude Code skills (`init-pantoken`, `create-pantoken-app`), plus [installAgentAssets](functions/installAgentAssets.md) /\n[scaffoldAndInit](functions/scaffoldAndInit.md) / the `pantoken-ai` CLI to drop them into a consumer repo at the\nconventional paths."
msgstr "Det inkluderer ein `AGENTS.md`, ein `llms.txt`, redaktør-/agentregel-filer (Cursor, Copilot, Windsurf), og\nClaude Code-ferdigheiter (`init-pantoken`, `create-pantoken-app`), pluss [installAgentAssets](functions/installAgentAssets.md) /\n[scaffoldAndInit](functions/scaffoldAndInit.md) / `pantoken-ai`-CLIen for å plassere dei i ein forbrukar-repo på dei\nkonvensjonelle plasseringane."

