msgid "[toPandaPreset](functions/toPandaPreset.md) converts any IR; [pantokenPreset](variables/pantokenPreset.md) is the ready-made `rebrand` preset.\nSpread it into your `panda.config.ts` `presets`, and the `_dark` condition tracks pantoken's\n`light-dark()` tokens automatically."
msgstr "[toPandaPreset](functions/toPandaPreset.md) konverterer alle IR; [pantokenPreset](variables/pantokenPreset.md) er det ferdige `rebrand`-presetet.\nSprei det inn i dine `panda.config.ts` `presets`, og `_dark`-tilstanden sporar pantoken sine\n`light-dark()`-tokener automatisk."

