#: css/alert.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-alert` · <span class=\"instui-pill -color-success pantoken-doc-tag\">stable</span> — An inline message with a status colour bar and a masked status glyph from the shared icon set."
msgstr "`.instui-alert` · <span class=\"instui-pill -color-success pantoken-doc-tag\">stable</span> — Ei inline-melding med ein statusfargebjelke og eit maskert statusikon frå det delte ikonetsettet."

#: css/alert.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A custom `-icon-<name>` swaps the status glyph but keeps the variant's coloured bar; the bar fill is re-asserted at higher specificity so the shared icon painter doesn't consume it. A direct close button defaults to small; add a size modifier to override it."
msgstr "Ei tilpassa `-icon-<name>` byter ut statusikonet, men held variantens fargebjelke; bjelkeutfyllinga blir re‑asserta med høgare spesiﬁkitet så den delte ikonmålaren ikkje tek henne. Ein direkte lukkeknapp brukar liten som standard; legg til ein storleiksmodiﬁkator for å overstyre."

#: css/alert.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [alert.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/alert/alert.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [alert.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/alert/alert.css)"

#: css/alert.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "JS Enhancement"
msgstr "JS-forbetring"

#: css/alert.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "This component's CSS renders and works on its own; pair it with `@pantoken/interactions` to add the interactive behavior. Its `-timeout` modifier is driven by that behavior. See the [modifier table below](#modifiers)."
msgstr "Denne komponenten si CSS renderar og fungerer sjølvstendig; par ho med `@pantoken/interactions` for å leggje til den interaktive åtferda. Hennar `-timeout`‑modiﬁkator blir driven av den åtferda. Sjå [modiﬁkator-tabellen nedanfor](#modifiers)."

#: css/alert.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "## Accessibility"
msgstr "## Tilgjenge"

#: css/alert.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "For an important message, add `role=\"alert\"` or an `aria-live` region so assistive tech announces it; the dismiss control is a labelled close button (the `.instui-close-button` in the example carries `aria-label=\"Close\"`)."
msgstr "For ei viktig melding, legg til `role=\"alert\"` eller eit `aria-live`‑område så hjelpemiddel‑teknologi kunngjer det; avvisingskontrollen er ein merka lukkeknapp (eksempelet sitt `.instui-close-button` ber `aria-label=\"Close\"`)."

#: css/alert.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "## Slots"
msgstr ""

