msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: breadcrumb.link"
msgstr ""

#: css/breadcrumb.link.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`li` · <span class=\"instui-pill -color-success pantoken-doc-tag\">stable</span> — A crumb (InstUI `Breadcrumb.Link`), an `<li>` in the parent's `<ol>`; the last one is the current page."
msgstr "`li` · <span class=\"instui-pill -color-success pantoken-doc-tag\">stabil</span> — Ein brødsmule (InstUI `Breadcrumb.Link`), ein `<li>` i foreldra sin `<ol>`; den siste er den gjeldande sida."

#: css/breadcrumb.link.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The parent `breadcrumb`'s `-size-sm`/`-size-lg` modifiers adjust this member's separator spacing — see `breadcrumb`'s own doc for those modifiers."
msgstr "Foreldra sin `breadcrumb` sine `-size-sm`/`-size-lg`-modifikatorar justerer dette medlemmet sin skiljar-avstand — sjå dokumentasjonen til `breadcrumb` for desse modifikatorane."

#: css/breadcrumb.link.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Mark the current page's crumb with `aria-current=\"page\"` — on its `<a>` if it's a link, otherwise on the `<li>` itself."
msgstr "Marker brødsmulen for den gjeldande sida med `aria-current=\"page\"` — på hennar `<a>` dersom det er ein lenke, elles på `<li>` sjølve."

