msgstr "Liten. @affects breadcrumb.link — Skalerer avstanden til smule‑skiljaren for å passe."

#: css/breadcrumb.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Small. @affects breadcrumb.link — Scales the crumb separator's spacing to match. Long-form alias of `-size-sm`."
msgstr "Liten. @affects breadcrumb.link — Skalerer avstanden til smule‑skiljaren for å passe. Langform-alias for `-size-sm`."

#: css/button.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: button"
msgstr ""

#: css/button.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-button` — An accessible action control, styled from the token palette; primary by default."
msgstr "`.instui-button` — Ein tilgjengeleg handlingskontroll, stilsett frå token-paletten; primær som standard."

#: css/button.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The AI variants layer two gradients — a padding-box fill and a border-box stroke — for their frame, and `-color-ai-secondary` can't paint gradient text and a fill at once, so its centre stays transparent at rest and fills on hover or active. `-without-background` hover and active derive a low-opacity, slightly-darkened brand wash rather than using the raw hover-background tokens, which would print same-colour-on-same-colour text. Also sets its own icon/label `gap` and horizontal `padding`; chaining a `-gap-*`/`-p-*`/`-padding-*` spacing utility modifier overrides those built-in values. The optional `.instui-button-group` wrapper maps Figma's `.buttonGroup` and owns adjacent button spacing."
msgstr "AI-variantane lagar to gradientar — eit padding-box-fyll og eit border-box-strekk — for ramma, og `-color-ai-secondary` kan ikkje måle gradienttekst og fyll samtidig, så midten vert transparent i kvile og fyllast ved hovring eller aktiv. `-without-background` hovring og aktiv avgjer ein låg-opasitet, svakt mørka merkevas for å unngå same-farge-tekst mot same-farge-bakgrunn. Set òg eigne ikon-/etikett-`gap` og horisontal `padding`; å lenkje ein `-gap-*`/`-p-*`/`-padding-*` spacing-utility-modifikator overskriv dei innebygde verdiane. Den valfrie `.instui-button-group` wrapperen kartlegg Figma sin `.buttonGroup` og eig naboknapp-avstand."

#: css/button.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [button.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/button/button.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [button.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/button/button.css)"

#: css/button.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Drive the `-toggle` variant's pressed state with `aria-pressed`, and mark a disabled button with `aria-disabled` (or the native `disabled`)."
msgstr "Styr `-toggle`-variantens trykt-tilstand med `aria-pressed`, og merk ein deaktiver knapp med `aria-disabled` (eller den native `disabled`)."

#: css/button.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A group wrapper lays out adjacent buttons with the shared button gap."
msgstr "Ei gruppe-wrapper legg ut naboknappar med delt knapp-avstand."

#: css/button.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "An AI action."
msgstr "Ein AI-handling."

#: css/button.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A lower-emphasis AI action."
msgstr "Ein lågare-empatisk AI-handling."

#: css/button.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A destructive action."
msgstr "Ein destruktiv handling."

#: css/button.md
