msgstr "Ringens strekbreidd; -size-* modifikatorane set den."

#: css/progress-circle.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The unfilled track colour."
msgstr "Fargen på det ikkje utfylte sporet."

#: css/progress-circle.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The current progress value; registered with @property so it can transition."
msgstr "Den noverande framdriftsverdien; registrert med @property slik at den kan gå gjennom ein overgang."

#: css/progress-circle.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "@alias {@link --max} The maximum progress value (default `100`)."
msgstr "@alias {@link --max} Den maksimale framdriftsverdien (standard `100`)."

#: css/progress-circle.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "@alias Alias for `--value`."
msgstr "@alias Eit alias for `--value`."

#: css/progress-circle.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- Registers the numeric progress properties with `@property` and paints with CSS `mask` and `conic-gradient`; where custom-property transitions are unsupported the ring still renders but won't animate."
msgstr "- Registrerer dei numeriske framdrifts-eigenskapane med `@property` og teiknar med CSS `mask` og `conic-gradient`; der overgangar for custom-properties ikkje er støtta, blir ringen framleis rendra, men vil ikkje animere."

#: css/progress-circle.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- [progress](/api/css/progress.md) — The linear bar form of the same determinate progress."
msgstr "[progress](/api/css/progress.md) — Den lineære stolpeforma av den same bestemte framdrifta."

#: css/progress.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: progress"
msgstr ""

#: css/progress.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-progress` · <span class=\"instui-pill -color-success pantoken-doc-tag\">stable</span> — A determinate progress bar with a coloured meter, sizes, and an optional value label."
msgstr "`.instui-progress` · <span class=\"instui-pill -color-success pantoken-doc-tag\">stable</span> — Ein determinert framdriftslinje med eit farga målarfelt, storleikar, og ei valfri verdimerkjing."

#: css/progress.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.value` is a sibling of `.bar`, both children of the root — mirroring how progress-circle nests its own `.value` part. InstUI has no indeterminate state; `:indeterminate` is a pantoken-only best guess (native `<progress>` without a `value` attribute), animating `.bar` as a sliding segment and hiding `.value` since there's no meaningful number to show. `<meter>` has no indeterminate state, so it's unaffected."
msgstr "`.value` er ein sysken til `.bar`, begge born av roten — som speglar korleis progress-circle nestar sin eigen `.value`-del. InstUI har inga ubestemt tilstand; `:indeterminate` er eit pantoken-eige beste gjetting (nativt `<progress>` utan eit `value`-attributt), animerer `.bar` som ein gliande segment og skjuler `.value` sidan det ikkje finst eit meiningsfullt tal å vise. `<meter>` har ingen ubestemt tilstand, så det vert ikkje påverka."

#: css/progress.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [progress.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/progress/progress.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [progress.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/progress/progress.css)"

#: css/progress.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Renders `.value` inside the track, aligned to its start, instead of beside it; style it for legibility over the meter colour."
msgstr "Renderer `.value` inne i sporet, justert til starten i staden for ved sida av; stilsett det for lesbarheit over målarfargen."

#: css/progress.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "<span class=\"instui-pill pantoken-doc-tag pantoken-doc-tag-interaction\">Interaction</span> — Animate meter changes over half a second."
msgstr ""

#: css/progress.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The filled meter bar."
msgstr "Det fylte målarfeltet."

#: css/progress.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The value text beside the bar."
msgstr "Verditeksten ved sida av linja."

#: css/progress.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Custom, not part of InstUI. Applies only to a native `<progress>` missing its `value` attribute; animates `.bar` as a sliding segment and hides `.value`."
msgstr "Eigenskap, ikkje ein del av InstUI. Gjelder kun for eit nativt `<progress>` som manglar sitt `value`-attributt; animerer `.bar` som eit gliande segment og skjuler `.value`."

#: css/progress.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Draws the track's bottom rule as its own layer over the meter, so the full border and the bottom border stay independent across themes."
msgstr "Teiknar sporets nedre linje som eit eige lag over målaren, slik at den fullstendige ramma og botnramma held seg uavhengige på tvers av tema."

#: css/progress.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The current progress value."
msgstr "Den noverande framdriftsverdien."

#: css/progress.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- Scopes the meter part rules with the `@scope` at-rule; browsers without `@scope` support ignore those scoped rules."
msgstr "- Skapar omfang for reglane til målar-delen med `@scope` at-regelen; nettlesarar utan støtte for `@scope` ignorerer desse scoped-reglane."

#: css/progress.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- [progress-circle](/api/css/progress-circle.md) — The circular form of the same determinate progress."
msgstr "- [progress-circle](/api/css/progress-circle.md) — Den sirkulære forma av same determinert framdrift."

#: css/prose.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: prose"
msgstr "# CSS: prose"

#: css/prose.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`:where(body)` — Typographic defaults for raw HTML — headings, paragraphs, lists, links, and code — applied automatically wherever it's imported (default `:where(body)`); pass `options.scope` to target a different content root instead (e.g. `.vp-doc`)."
msgstr "`:where(body)` — typografiske standardar for rå HTML — overskrifter, avsnitt, lister, lenker og kode — blir brukt automatisk der det blir importert (standard `:where(body)`); bruk `options.scope` for å sikte mot ei anna innhaldsrot i staden (t.d. `.vp-doc`)."

#: css/prose.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [index.ts](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/rules/prose/index.ts)"
msgstr "**Source:** [index.ts](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/rules/prose/index.ts)"

#: css/radio-input-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: radio-input-group"
msgstr ""

#: css/radio-input-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-radio-input-group` — A single-select radio `<fieldset>`, plain or as a connected segmented toggle."
msgstr "`.instui-radio-input-group` — Ein enkeltval radioknapp `<fieldset>`, enkel eller som ein samankopla segmentert veksle."

#: css/radio-input-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Sets its own `gap` between radios; chaining a `-gap-*` spacing utility modifier overrides that built-in value."
msgstr "Set sitt eige `gap` mellom radioknappar; å kjetta ein `-gap-*` mellomroms‑utility‑modifikator overstyrer den innebygde verdien."

#: css/radio-input-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [radio-input-group.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/radio-input-group/radio-input-group.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [radio-input-group.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/radio-input-group/radio-input-group.css)"

#: css/radio-input-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Renders a native `<fieldset>` with a `<legend>` that names the group; the child radios share one `name`, so only one can be selected at a time."
msgstr "Rendrar ein innfødd `<fieldset>` med ein `<legend>` som namngjev gruppa; dei underordna radioknappane deler ein `name`, så berre éin kan veljast om gongen."

#: css/radio-input-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### Toggle variant"
msgstr ""

#: css/radio-input-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Lay the radios out in columns."
msgstr "Legg ut radioknappane i kolonnar."

#: css/radio-input-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Lay the radios out inline."
msgstr "Legg ut radioknappane på ei rad."

#: css/radio-input-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Lay the child toggles out as a segmented control (only the selected segment fills)."
msgstr "Legg ut dei underordna vekslarane som ei segmentert kontroll (berre det valde segmentet fyller)."

#: css/radio-input-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- [radio](/api/css/radio.md) — The individual control this group collects.\n- [form-field-group](/api/css/form-field-group.md) — The general wrapper for grouping and laying out fields."
msgstr "- [radio](/api/css/radio.md) — Den enkelte kontrollen denne gruppa samlar.\n- [form-field-group](/api/css/form-field-group.md) — Den generelle innpakninga for gruppering og oppstilling av felt."

#: css/radio.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: radio"
msgstr ""

#: css/radio.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-radio` — A native radio button and its label."
msgstr "`.instui-radio` — Ein innfødd radioknapp og etiketten sin."

#: css/radio.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Sets its own `gap` between the control and its label; chaining a `-gap-*` spacing utility modifier overrides that built-in value."
msgstr "Settar sin eigen `gap` mellom kontrollen og etiketten; å lenkje ein `-gap-*` mellomromsmodifikator overstyrer den innebygde verdien."

#: css/radio.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [radio.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/radio/radio.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [radio.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/radio/radio.css)"

#: css/radio.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A native `<input type=\"radio\">` drives `:checked` and `:disabled`; `-readonly` is styling only, since radios have no native readonly attribute."
msgstr "Ein innfødd `<input type=\"radio\">` styrer `:checked` og `:disabled`; `-readonly` er berre styling, sidan radioknappar ikkje har eit innfødd readonly‑attributt."

#: css/radio.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Danger context colour (toggle variant)."
msgstr "Farge for farekontekst (toggle‑variant)."

#: css/radio.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Off/neutral context colour (toggle variant)."
msgstr "Av/nøytral kontekstfarge (toggle‑variant)."

#: css/radio.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Success context colour (toggle variant)."
msgstr "Farge for suksesskontekst (toggle‑variant)."

#: css/radio.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Warning context colour (toggle variant)."
msgstr "Farge for varselkontekst (toggle‑variant)."

#: css/radio.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "<span class=\"instui-pill -color-info pantoken-doc-tag\">Alias</span> — maps to `.-variant-toggle`."
msgstr ""

#: css/radio.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Render as a segmented toggle button."
msgstr "Vis som ein segmentert toggle‑knapp."

#: css/radio.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The filled inner dot shown when checked; on `-variant-toggle` it is the focus ring drawn just outside the pill."
msgstr "Den fylte indre prikken som visast når valt; på `-variant-toggle` er det fokusringen teikna rett utanfor pillen."

#: css/radio.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The toggle's selected fill colour; the -context-* modifiers set it."
msgstr "Toggle‑en si valde fyllfarge; -context-*‑modifikatorane bestemmer ho."

#: css/radio.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- [checkbox](/api/css/checkbox.md) — The multi-select counterpart to a single-select radio.\n- [radio-input-group](/api/css/radio-input-group.md) — Collects radios into one single-select fieldset."
msgstr "- [checkbox](/api/css/checkbox.md) — Fleirvalsmotsvar til ein einvalsradio.\n- [radio-input-group](/api/css/radio-input-group.md) — Samlar radioknappar i eit feltsett for einval."

#: css/range-input.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: range-input"
msgstr ""

#: css/range-input.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-range-input` — A styled range slider with an inverse value bubble."
msgstr "`.instui-range-input` — Ein stilsett områdeglidebrytar med ein invertert verdiboble."

#: css/range-input.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Each vendor thumb/track pseudo-element needs its own separate rule — grouping them in one selector list would invalidate the whole rule in browsers that don't recognize the other vendor's pseudo."
msgstr "Kvar leverandør sitt thumb-/track-pseudo-element treng sin eigen regel — å gruppere dei i ei selektorliste vil ugyldiggjere heile regelen i nettlesarar som ikkje kjenner igjen den andre leverandøren sin pseudo."

#: css/range-input.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [range-input.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/range-input/range-input.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [range-input.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/range-input/range-input.css)"

#: css/range-input.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The control is a native `<input type=\"range\">`; give it an accessible name with `aria-label` or an associated `<label>`."
msgstr "Kontrollen er ein innebygd `<input type=\"range\">`; gi den eit tilgjengeleg namn med `aria-label` eller eit tilknytt `<label>`."

#: css/range-input.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Draws the value bubble's caret, a small triangle pointing back toward the track."
msgstr "Teiknar pekaren til verdibobla (caret), ein liten trekant som peikar tilbake mot sporet."

#: css/range-input.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- [number-input](/api/css/number-input.md) — The typed numeric-entry counterpart."
msgstr "- [number-input](/api/css/number-input.md) — Den tastede numeriske inntastingsmotparten."

#: css/rating.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: rating"
msgstr ""

#: css/rating.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-rating` — A star rating with filled and empty glyphs and an optional numeric label."
msgstr "`.instui-rating` — Ein stjernevurdering med fylte og tomme ikon­teikn og ein valfri numerisk etikett."

#: css/rating.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Sets its own `gap` between star glyphs; chaining a `-gap-*` spacing utility modifier overrides that built-in value."
msgstr "Settar sin eigen `gap` mellom stjerneikon; å kjede ein `-gap-*` mellomroms-utility-modifikator overstyrer den innebygde verdien."

#: css/rating.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [rating.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/rating/rating.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [rating.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/rating/rating.css)"

#: css/rating.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Give it role=\"img\" and an aria-label stating the rating, since the stars are icon glyphs."
msgstr "Gje det role=\"img\" og ein aria-label som opplyser vurderinga, sidan stjernene er ikon­teikn."

#: css/rating.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Render star glyphs with icon classes (for example, `-icon-star-solid`)."
msgstr "Gjer stjerneikon synlege ved hjelp av ikonklassar (til dømes, `-icon-star-solid`)."

#: css/rating.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The numeric label, e.g. \"3/5\"."
msgstr "Den numeriske etiketten, t.d. \"3/5\"."

#: css/responsive.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: responsive"
msgstr ""

#: css/responsive.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`[class*=\"-hidden-\"],[class*=\"-show-\"]` — Viewport- or container-width show/hide classes across a themed breakpoint scale."
msgstr "`[class*=\"-hidden-\"],[class*=\"-show-\"]` — Vis-/skjul-klassar basert på visningsvindauge- eller behaldarbreidd over ei tematisk breakpoint-skala."

#: css/responsive.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-hidden-max-<bp>`/`-hidden-min-<bp>` hide by viewport width; `.instui-show-max-<bp>`/`-show-min-<bp>` are the inverse (hidden by default, shown only inside the range via `display: revert`); the `-cq-` variants react to a `.instui-container` ancestor's width instead, not the viewport's. Scale tiers `xs`/`sm`/`md`/`lg`/`xl` (sourced from the IR's tray-width component tokens) are each aliased to a long-form spelling (`x-small`–`x-large`) and a device name (`mobile`/`phablet`/`tablet`/`laptop`/`desktop`) — both deprecated in favor of the short name — plus the unscaled, themed `content`/`content-full-width` tiers (the main content area's max-width)."
msgstr "`.instui-hidden-max-<bp>`/`-hidden-min-<bp>` skjuler etter visningsvindaugsbreidd; `.instui-show-max-<bp>`/`-show-min-<bp>` er omvendt (skjult som standard, viser berre innan området via `display: revert`); `-cq-`-variantane reagerer i staden på eit `.instui-container`-forfedres breidd, ikkje på visningsvindauget. Skala-trinna `xs`/`sm`/`md`/`lg`/`xl` (henta frå IR-en sin tray-width-komponenttoken) har kvar ei langform-variant (`x-small`–`x-large`) og eit enhetsnamn (`mobile`/`phablet`/`tablet`/`laptop`/`desktop`) — begge er utdatert til fordel for kortnamnet — pluss dei u-skalerte, tematiserte `content`/`content-full-width`-trinna (maks-breidd for hovudinhaldsområdet)."

#: css/responsive.md
