#: css/rubric-note.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: rubric-note"
msgstr ""

#: css/rubric-note.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`div[class~=\"instui-rubric-note\"]` — Structured note with rubric categories and scoring indicators."
msgstr "`div[class~=\"instui-rubric-note\"]` — Strukturert merknad med rubrikkategoriar og poengindikatorar."

#: css/rubric-note.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "✅ Use Rubric-Note when:"
msgstr "✅ Bruk Rubric-Note når:"

#: css/rubric-note.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- Displaying grading rubric or assessment criteria\n- You need to structure content by category with scores or indicators\n- The layout should emphasize structure and hierarchy\n🚫 Don't use Rubric-Note when:"
msgstr "- Vise vurderingsrubrikk eller vurderingskriterium\n- Du treng å strukturere innhald etter kategori med poeng eller indikatorar\n- Oppsettet bør framheve struktur og hierarki\n🚫 Ikkje bruk Rubric-Note når:"

#: css/rubric-note.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- Displaying simple notes or comments — use Callout instead\n- Complex grading logic is needed — consider a custom component"
msgstr "- Viser enkle merknader eller kommentarar — bruk heller Callout\n- Det trengs kompleks vurderingslogikk — vurder ein tilpassa komponent"

#: css/rubric-note.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- Use table semantics if displaying a true rubric with rows and columns\n- Ensure score indicators are not color-only\n- Provide descriptive labels for each category"
msgstr "- Bruk tabellsemantikk om du viser ei ekte rubrikk med rader og kolonnar\n- Sørg for at poengindikatorar ikkje berre er baserte på farge\n- Gje beskrivande etikettar for kvar kategori"

#: css/rubric-note.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Container for rubric criteria rows."
msgstr "Behaldar for radene med rubrikkriteriar."

#: css/rubric-note.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Detailed description of the criterion."
msgstr "Detaljert beskriving av kriteriet."

#: css/rubric-note.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Header with title and metadata."
msgstr "Overskrift med tittel og metadata."

#: css/rubric-note.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Criterion name or category."
msgstr "Namnet på kriteriet eller kategori."

#: css/rubric-note.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Individual criterion row."
msgstr "Ein rad for eit enkelt kriterium."

#: css/rubric-note.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Score indicator or badge."
msgstr "Poengindikator eller merke."

#: css/screen-reader-content.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: screen-reader-content"
msgstr "# CSS: screen-reader-content"

#: css/screen-reader-content.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-screen-reader-content` — Visually hides content while keeping it available to assistive tech (the standard clip pattern)."
msgstr "`.instui-screen-reader-content` — Gøymer innhald visuelt samtidig som det held fram med å vere tilgjengeleg for hjelpemiddelteknologi (standard clip-mønster)."

#: css/screen-reader-content.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [screen-reader-content.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/utilities/screen-reader-content/screen-reader-content.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [screen-reader-content.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/utilities/screen-reader-content/screen-reader-content.css)"

#: css/screen-reader-content.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Keeps text in the accessibility tree for screen readers while removing it from the visual layout."
msgstr "Beheld teksten i tilgjengelegheitstreet for skjermlesarar samtidig som han blir fjerna frå den visuelle oppsetnaden."

#: css/side-nav-bar.item.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: side-nav-bar.item"
msgstr ""

#: css/side-nav-bar.item.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.item` — A navigation entry (InstUI `SideNavBar.Item`); `-selected` marks the active one."
msgstr "`.item` — Ein navigasjonsoppføring (InstUI `SideNavBar.Item`); `-selected` markerer den aktive."

#: css/side-nav-bar.item.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The parent `side-nav-bar`'s `-minimized` modifier hides this member's `.label` — see `side-nav-bar`'s own doc for that modifier."
msgstr "Den overordna `side-nav-bar` sitt `-minimized`-modifikator skjuler dette medlemmet sitt `.label` — sjå `side-nav-bar` sin eigen dokumentasjon for den modifikatoren."

#: css/side-nav-bar.item.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The active nav item."
msgstr "Det aktive navigasjonselementet."

#: css/side-nav-bar.item.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The item's text label; hidden when the rail is minimized."
msgstr "Oppføringa si tekstetikett; skjult når sidefeltet er minimert."

#: css/side-nav-bar.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: side-nav-bar"
msgstr ""

#: css/side-nav-bar.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-side-nav-bar` — A vertical navigation rail of icon-over-label items, with a minimized icons-only mode."
msgstr "`.instui-side-nav-bar` — ein vertikal navigasjonsrail med ikon over etikett, med ein minimert berre-ikon-modus."

#: css/side-nav-bar.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Sets its own `gap` between nav items and its own `padding`; chaining a `-gap-*`/`-p-*`/`-padding-*` spacing utility modifier overrides those built-in values. See the `side-nav-bar.item` member for the individual nav entries."
msgstr "Set sitt eige `gap` mellom navigasjonsoppføringane og sitt eige `padding`; ved å lenkje ein `-gap-*`/`-p-*`/`-padding-*` mellomroms-utility-modifikator overskrivast desse innebygde verdiane. Sjå `side-nav-bar.item`-medlemmet for dei individuelle navigasjonsoppføringane."

#: css/side-nav-bar.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [item.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/side-nav-bar/members/item/item.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [item.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/side-nav-bar/members/item/item.css)"

#: css/side-nav-bar.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Label the `<nav>` with aria-label so it's announced as a named navigation landmark."
msgstr "Gje `<nav>` ei aria-label slik at den blir kunngjort som eit namngitt navigasjonslandemerke."

#: css/side-nav-bar.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Render a glyph icon in each nav item."
msgstr "Vis eit glyfikon i kvar navigasjonsoppføring."

#: css/side-nav-bar.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Collapse to icons only (labels hidden). @affects side-nav-bar.item — Hides the item's label."
msgstr "Kollaps til berre ikon (etikettar skjulte). @affects side-nav-bar.item — Gøymer etiketten til elementet."

#: css/side-nav-bar.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The nav item's text label."
msgstr "Tekstetiketten til navigasjonsoppføringa."

#: css/simple-select.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: simple-select"
msgstr ""

#: css/simple-select.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-simple-select` — A styled native `<select>` with a caret, matching the text-input states and sizes."
msgstr "`.instui-simple-select` — Ein stylad native `<select>` med ein caret, som samsvarar med text-input-tilstandar og -storleikar."

#: css/simple-select.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Wraps a plain native `<select>` with no custom dropdown/menu markup, so browser-native option rendering and keyboard behavior apply as-is; it shares its field chrome with `text-input`."
msgstr "Omsluttar ein enkel native `<select>` utan tilpassa rullegardin-/menymarkup, så nettlesarens eigen renderering av val og tastaturatferd gjeld som dei er; han deler feltutseendet sitt med `text-input`."

#: css/simple-select.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [select.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/select/select.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [select.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/select/select.css)"

#: css/simple-select.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The placeholder text, in a muted color that shifts on hover."
msgstr "Plasshaldarteksten, i ein dempa farge som endrar seg når ein held musepeikaren over."

#: css/simple-select.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- [text-input](/api/css/text-input.md) — Shares the same field chrome, states, and sizes.\n- [menu](/api/css/menu.md) — The dropdown surface a richer select reuses."
msgstr "- [text-input](/api/css/text-input.md) — Delar same feltutseende, tilstandar og storleikar.\n- [menu](/api/css/menu.md) — Dropdown-flata som ein meir funksjonsrik select gjenbrukar."

#: css/spacing.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: spacing"
msgstr ""

#: css/spacing.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.--p-md` — Margin and padding utilities — `.--m<side>-<step>` / `.--margin-<side>-<step>` and `.--p<side>-<step>` / `.--padding-<side>-<step>` on the spacing scale (sides `t`/`b`/`s`/`e`/`x`/`y` or none, spelled short or fully long — for example `--mb-sm` and `--margin-bottom-small` are the same rule; margin also takes `auto`). Usable bare or chained onto any component (for example `class=\"instui-view --mb-sm\"`)."
msgstr "`.--p-md` — Margin- og padding‑verktøy — `.--m<side>-<step>` / `.--margin-<side>-<step>` og `.--p<side>-<step>` / `.--padding-<side>-<step>` på avstandsskalaen (sider `t`/`b`/`s`/`e`/`x`/`y` eller ingen, skriva kort eller heilt ut — til dømes `--mb-sm` og `--margin-bottom-small` er same regel; margin kan òg ta `auto`). Kan brukast åleine eller kjedast på ein komponent (til dømes `class=\"instui-view --mb-sm\"`)."

#: css/spacing.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [index.ts](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/utilities/spacing/index.ts)"
msgstr "**Source:** [index.ts](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/utilities/spacing/index.ts)"

#: css/spacing.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Applies medium padding on all sides."
msgstr "Gjev middels padding på alle sider."

#: css/spacing.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Margin utilities across short, legacy-long, and fully long spellings."
msgstr "Margin‑verktøy for korte, legacy-lange og fullstendig lange skrivemåtar."

#: css/spacing.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Padding utilities across short, legacy-long, and fully long spellings."
msgstr "Padding‑verktøy for korte, legacy-lange og fullstendig lange skrivemåtar."

#: css/spinner.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: spinner"
msgstr ""

#: css/spinner.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-spinner` — An animated loading ring; give it role=\"status\" and an aria-label."
msgstr "`.instui-spinner` — ein animert lastesirkel; gi den role=\"status\" og eit aria-label."

#: css/spinner.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`-color-inverse` only repaints the animated top border segment, not the whole track, so it still reads correctly on a dark card without needing a separate track color."
msgstr "`-color-inverse` teiknar berre om det animerte øvste kantsegmentet, ikkje heile sporet, så det framleis lesast korrekt på eit mørkt kort utan å trenge ein eigen sporfarge."

#: css/spinner.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [spinner.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/spinner/spinner.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [spinner.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/spinner/spinner.css)"

#: css/spinner.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Give the spinner role=\"status\" and an aria-label so screen readers announce it as a live loading status."
msgstr "Gi spinneren role=\"status\" og eit aria-label slik at skjermlesarar kunngjer han som ein levande lastestatus."

#: css/spinner.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### Inverse color -nocard"
msgstr ""

#: css/spinner.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "On a dark surface."
msgstr "På ein mørk overflate."

#: css/spinner.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Extra-small. Long-form alias of `-size-xs`."
msgstr "Ekstra-liten. Langform-alias for `-size-xs`."

#: css/spinner.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Extra-small."
msgstr "Ekstra-liten."

#: css/stacking.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: stacking"
msgstr ""

#: css/stacking.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.--stack-topmost` — z-index depth utilities — `.--stack-<level>` (`deepest`, `below`, `above`, `topmost`) — usable bare or chained onto any component, so layers stack predictably instead of by hand-tuned numbers."
msgstr "`.--stack-topmost` — z-index djupneverktøy — `.--stack-<level>` (`deepest`, `below`, `above`, `topmost`) — kan brukast sjølvstendig eller kjedast på kvar komponent, så lag stablar seg føreseieleg i staden for handjusterte tal."

#: css/stacking.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [index.ts](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/utilities/stacking/index.ts)"
msgstr "**Source:** [index.ts](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/utilities/stacking/index.ts)"

#: css/stacking.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Above the default flow."
msgstr "Over standardflyten."

#: css/stacking.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Below the default flow."
msgstr "Under standardflyten."

#: css/stacking.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The lowest stacking depth."
msgstr "Den lågaste stablinga."

#: css/stacking.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The highest stacking depth (overlays, menus)."
msgstr "Den høgaste stablinga (overlegg, menyar)."

#: css/table.body.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: table.body"
msgstr "# CSS: table.body"

#: css/table.body.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`tbody` — The table's data row group (InstUI `Table.Body`)."
msgstr "`tbody` — Tabellen sin dataradgruppe (InstUI `Table.Body`)."

#: css/table.body.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The parent `table`'s `-layout-stacked` modifier restyles this member — see `table`'s own doc for that modifier."
msgstr "Den overordna `table` sin `-layout-stacked`-modifikator endrar stilen til dette medlemmet — sjå dokumentasjonen til `table` for den modifikatoren."

#: css/table.cell.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: table.cell"
msgstr "# CSS: table.cell"

#: css/table.cell.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`td` — A data cell (InstUI `Table.Cell`)."
msgstr "`td` — ein datacelle (InstUI `Table.Cell`)."

#: css/table.cell.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The parent `table`'s `-layout-stacked` modifier stacks this member as a block and labels it via `::before` — see `table`'s own doc for that modifier."
msgstr "Den overordna `table` sin `-layout-stacked`-modifikator plasserer dette medlemmet som ein blokk og merkar det via `::before` — sjå dokumentasjonen til `table` for den modifikatoren."

#: css/table.col-header.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: table.col-header"
msgstr "# CSS: table.col-header"

#: css/table.col-header.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`th` — A column-header cell (InstUI `Table.ColHeader`); the default `th` styling, overridden by `table.row-header` for `th[scope=\"row\"]`."
msgstr "`th` — Ein kolonneoverskriftscelle (InstUI `Table.ColHeader`); standard `th`-styling, overstyrt av `table.row-header` for `th[scope=\"row\"]`."

#: css/table.head.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: table.head"
msgstr "# CSS: table.head"

#: css/table.head.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`thead` — The table's header row group (InstUI `Table.Head`)."
msgstr "`thead` — Tabellens overskriftsrad-gruppe (InstUI `Table.Head`)."

#: css/table.head.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The parent `table`'s `-layout-stacked` modifier visually hides this member (its column titles surface per-cell instead) — see `table`'s own doc for that modifier."
msgstr "Den overordna `table` sin `-layout-stacked`-modifikator skjuler dette medlemmet visuelt (kolonnetitlane kjem fram per celle i staden) — sjå `table` si eiga dokumentasjon for den modifikatoren."

#: css/table.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: table"
msgstr ""

#: css/table.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-table` — A styled data table for `th` and `td` plus an optional caption, with hover, fixed, and stacked-card layouts."
msgstr "`.instui-table` — Ei stilisert datatabell for `th` og `td` pluss ein valfri bilettekst, med hover-, fast- og stablet-kort-oppsett."

#: css/table.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "For `-layout-stacked`, pure CSS can't pull each column header's text into its cell, so give every cell a `data-label` and the stacked card shows it via `::before`. See the `table.head`, `table.body`, `table.row`, `table.cell`, `table.col-header`, and `table.row-header` members for the individual parts."
msgstr "For `-layout-stacked` kan ikkje rein CSS hente kvar kolonneoverskrift sin tekst inn i cella, så gi kvar celle ein `data-label` og det stablede kortet viser han via `::before`. Sjå medlemmene `table.head`, `table.body`, `table.row`, `table.cell`, `table.col-header` og `table.row-header` for dei enkelte delane."

#: css/table.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [body.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/table/members/body/body.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [body.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/table/members/body/body.css)"

#: css/table.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Label the table with a `<caption>`, mark column headers `<th scope=\"col\">` and row headers `<th scope=\"row\">`, and in `-layout-stacked` give every cell a `data-label` since the header row is visually hidden."
msgstr "Merk tabellen med ein `<caption>`, merk kolonneoverskriftene som `<th scope=\"col\">` og radoverskriftene som `<th scope=\"row\">`, og i `-layout-stacked` gi kvar celle ein `data-label` sidan header-raden er visuelt skjult."

#: css/table.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Highlight rows on hover. @affects table.row — Reserves and colours the row's hover border."
msgstr "Framhev rader ved hover. @affects table.row — Reserverer og fargar radens hover-ramme."

#: css/table.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Fixed table layout (equal-width columns)."
msgstr "Fast tabelloppsett (kolonner med lik breidd)."

#: css/table.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Stack each row as a card, via a per-cell `data-label`. @affects table.head @affects table.body @affects table.row @affects table.cell @affects table.col-header @affects table.row-header — Stacks each part as a block and hides/labels the header accordingly."
msgstr "Stable kvar rad som eit kort, via ein per-celle `data-label`. @affects table.head @affects table.body @affects table.row @affects table.cell @affects table.col-header @affects table.row-header — Stabler kvar del som ein blokk og skjuler/merkar headeren tilsvarande."

#: css/table.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "An optional table caption."
msgstr "Ein valfri tabellbilettekst."

#: css/table.row-header.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: table.row-header"
msgstr "# CSS: table.row-header"

#: css/table.row-header.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`th[scope=\"row\"]` — A row-header cell (InstUI `Table.RowHeader`); styled from the row-header tokens, not the column-header ones."
msgstr "`th[scope=\"row\"]` — Ein radhovudcelle (InstUI `Table.RowHeader`); stilsett frå radhovud-tokena, ikkje frå kolonnehovud-tokena."

#: css/table.row.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: table.row"
msgstr "# CSS: table.row"

#: css/table.row.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`tr` — A table row (InstUI `Table.Row`)."
msgstr "`tr` — Ei tabellrad (InstUI `Table.Row`)."

#: css/table.row.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The parent `table`'s `-hover` and `-layout-stacked` modifiers restyle this member — see `table`'s own doc for those modifiers."
msgstr "Den overordna `table` si `-hover` og `-layout-stacked` modifikatorar endrar stilen til dette medlemmet — sjå `table` si eiga dokumentasjon for desse modifikatorane."

#: css/tabs.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: tabs"
msgstr ""

#: css/tabs.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-tabs` — A tabbed panel set: a tab list, selectable tabs, and their panels."
msgstr "`.instui-tabs` — Eit sett med flikpanel: ei flikliste, valbare flikar og panela deira."

#: css/tabs.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "See the `tabs.tab` and `tabs.panel` members for the individual tab buttons and their content panels."
msgstr "Sjå medlemane `tabs.tab` og `tabs.panel` for dei einskilde flikknappane og innhaldspanela deira."

#: css/tabs.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [panel.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/tabs/members/panel/panel.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [panel.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/tabs/members/panel/panel.css)"

#: css/tabs.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Wire the tab list with role=\"tablist\", each tab with role=\"tab\" and aria-selected, and each panel with role=\"tabpanel\"."
msgstr "Kople fliklista til role=\"tablist\", kvar flik til role=\"tab\" og aria-selected, og kvart panel til role=\"tabpanel\"."

#: css/tabs.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Keep the tab list on one line and let it scroll horizontally instead of wrapping, hiding the scrollbar."
msgstr "Hald fliklista på ei linje og lat ho skrolle horisontalt i staden for å brytast — gøym rullefeltet."

#: css/tabs.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Rounded \"folder\" tabs with a selected tab that visually connects into the panel below. @affects tabs.tab — Restyles the tab buttons into the rounded \"folder\" look."
msgstr "Runda \"mappe\"-flikar med ei vald flik som visuelt heng saman med panelet under. @affects tabs.tab — Endrar stilen på flikknappane til det runda \"mappe\"-utseendet."

#: css/tabs.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The row of tabs."
msgstr "Raden med flikar."

#: css/tabs.panel.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: tabs.panel"
msgstr "# CSS: tabs.panel"

#: css/tabs.panel.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.panel` — The content panel for a tab (InstUI `Tabs.Panel`)."
msgstr "`.panel` — Innhaldspanelet for ei fane (InstUI `Tabs.Panel`)."

#: css/tabs.tab.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: tabs.tab"
msgstr ""

#: css/tabs.tab.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.tab` — A single tab button (InstUI `Tabs.Tab`, configured via the parent `Tabs`'s tab list); `-selected` marks the active one."
msgstr "`.tab` — Ein enkelt fane-knapp (InstUI `Tabs.Tab`, konfigurert via forelderen `Tabs` sin faneliste); `-selected` markerer den aktive."

#: css/tabs.tab.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The parent `tabs`'s `-variant-secondary` modifier restyles this member into a rounded \"folder\" tab — see `tabs`'s own doc for that modifier."
msgstr "Forelderen `tabs` sin `-variant-secondary`-modifikator endrar stilen til dette medlemmet til ei rund \"mappe\"-fane — sjå dokumentasjonen til `tabs` for den modifikatoren."

#: css/tabs.tab.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Non-interactive; same styling as `[aria-disabled=\"true\"]`/`:disabled`."
msgstr "Ikkje-interaktiv; same utforming som `[aria-disabled=\"true\"]`/`:disabled`."

#: css/tabs.tab.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The active tab; same styling as `[aria-selected=\"true\"]`."
msgstr "Den aktive fana; same utforming som `[aria-selected=\"true\"]`."

#: css/tag.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: tag"
msgstr ""

#: css/tag.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-tag` — An inline chip for a keyword or filter."
msgstr "`.instui-tag` — Ein inline-brikke for eit nøkkelord eller filter."

#: css/tag.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Sets its own horizontal `padding` (`-size-sm`/`-size-lg` scale it); chaining a `-p-*`/`-padding-*` spacing utility modifier overrides that built-in value."
msgstr "Set sin eigen horisontale `padding` (`-size-sm`/`-size-lg` skalerer han); kjeding av ein `-p-*`/`-padding-*` spacing utility-modifikator overstyrer den innebygde verdien."

#: css/tag.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [tag.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/tag/tag.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [tag.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/tag/tag.css)"

#: css/tag.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Reads inline with text and gets a trailing dismiss glyph."
msgstr "Les som inline med tekst og får eit avsluttande lukkesymbol."

#: css/tag.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Read-only (non-dismissable) tag."
msgstr "Berre-lese (ikkje avvisbar) tagg."

#: css/tag.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A large tag. Long-form alias of `-size-lg`."
msgstr "Ein stor tagg. Langforma alias for `-size-lg`."

#: css/tag.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A large tag."
msgstr "Ein stor tagg."

#: css/tag.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A small tag."
msgstr "Ein liten tagg."

#: css/tag.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A small tag. Long-form alias of `-size-sm`."
msgstr "Ein liten tagg. Langforma alias for `-size-sm`."

#: css/tag.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Renders the trailing dismiss glyph on a dismissible inline tag."
msgstr "Viser det avsluttande lukkesymbolet på ei avvisbar inline-tagg."

#: css/tag.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- [pill](/api/css/pill.md) — The read-only label-chip counterpart."
msgstr "- [pill](/api/css/pill.md) — Det berre-lese motstykket til label-chip."

#: css/testimonial.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: testimonial"
msgstr ""

#: css/testimonial.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`div[class~=\"instui-testimonial\"]` — Quote or testimonial display with attribution and optional imagery."
msgstr "`div[class~=\"instui-testimonial\"]` — Sitat- eller attestvising med attribusjon og valfritt bilete."

#: css/testimonial.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "✅ Use Testimonial when:"
msgstr "✅ Bruk Testimonial når:"

#: css/testimonial.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- Displaying customer or user testimonials and quotes\n- You want to highlight a statement with visual emphasis\n- Attribution and context (name, title, image) are important\n🚫 Don't use Testimonial when:"
msgstr "- Viser kundar eller brukarar sine attestar og sitat\n- Du vil framheve ei uttale med visuell vekt\n- Attribusjon og kontekst (namn, tittel, bilete) er viktige\n🚫 Bruk ikkje Testimonial når:"

#: css/testimonial.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- Displaying inline quotes in body text — use a blockquote element instead\n- The statement is the main focus — use Hero or Card instead"
msgstr "- Viser inline-sitat i brødtekst — bruk eit blockquote-element i staden\n- Uttalen er hovudfokuset — bruk Hero eller Card i staden"

#: css/testimonial.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- Use `<blockquote>` semantically for the quote\n- Ensure attribution is clear and associated with the quote\n- If using images, provide alt text"
msgstr "- Bruk `<blockquote>` semantisk for sitatet\n- Sørg for at attribusjonen er tydeleg og knytt til sitatet\n- Om du brukar bilete, legg ved alternativ tekst"

#: css/testimonial.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Attribution author name."
msgstr "Forfattarens namn (attribusjon)."

#: css/testimonial.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Optional author profile image."
msgstr "Valfritt bilete av forfattarens profil."

#: css/testimonial.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Container for quote and attribution."
msgstr "Behaldar for sitat og attribusjon."

#: css/testimonial.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The quoted text."
msgstr "Den siterte teksten."

#: css/testimonial.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Optional author title or affiliation."
msgstr "Valfri forfattartittel eller tilknyting."

#: css/text-area.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: text-area"
msgstr ""

#: css/text-area.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-text-area` — A styled, resizable native `<textarea>` with the same states and sizes as the text input."
msgstr "`.instui-text-area` — Eit styla, storleiksendrbar native `<textarea>` med dei same tilstandane og storleikane som tekstfeltet."

#: css/text-area.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Shares its border, background, and focus states with `text-input` and `simple-select`; only `resize: vertical` and the taller minimum height are unique to it."
msgstr "Delar ramma, bakgrunnen og fokustilstandane sine med `text-input` og `simple-select`; berre `resize: vertical` og den høgare minimumshøgda er unike for den."

#: css/text-area.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [text-area.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/text-area/text-area.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [text-area.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/text-area/text-area.css)"

#: css/text-area.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- [text-input](/api/css/text-input.md) — The single-line counterpart with the same states and sizes."
msgstr "- [text-input](/api/css/text-input.md) — Den einlinja motparten med dei same tilstandane og storleikane."

#: css/text-input.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: text-input"
msgstr ""

#: css/text-input.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-text-input` — A styled native `<input>` — including `date`, `time`, and `datetime-local`, where the browser supplies the picker — with validation states and sizes."
msgstr "`.instui-text-input` — Ein stylast innfødd `<input>` — inkludert `date`, `time`, og `datetime-local`, der nettlesaren leverer veljaren — med valideringstilstandar og storleikar."

#: css/text-input.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Shares its border, background, and state chrome with `text-area`, `simple-select`, `number-input`, and `input-group`; for `date`/`time`/`datetime-local` types the browser supplies its own picker UI, which this stylesheet doesn't style."
msgstr "Delar ramme, bakgrunn og tilstandskrom med `text-area`, `simple-select`, `number-input` og `input-group`; for `date`/`time`/`datetime-local`-typar leverer nettlesaren eigen veljar-UI, som dette stilarket ikkje stylar."

#: css/text-input.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [text-input.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/text-input/text-input.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [text-input.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/text-input/text-input.css)"

#: css/text-input.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- [text-area](/api/css/text-area.md) — The multi-line counterpart with the same states and sizes.\n- [number-input](/api/css/number-input.md) — The numeric-entry input sharing this chrome.\n- [simple-select](/api/css/simple-select.md) — The native select sharing this field chrome.\n- [input-group](/api/css/input-group.md) — Wraps this input with leading and trailing slots."
msgstr "- [text-area](/api/css/text-area.md) — Den fleirlinja motparten med same tilstandar og storleikar.\n- [number-input](/api/css/number-input.md) — Talinnskrivingsfeltet som delar denne kromen.\n- [simple-select](/api/css/simple-select.md) — Den innfødde selecten som delar denne feltskromen.\n- [input-group](/api/css/input-group.md) — Pakker dette inndatafeltet med føre- og etterslotar."

#: css/text.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: text"
msgstr ""

#: css/text.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-text` · <span class=\"instui-pill -color-success pantoken-doc-tag\">stable</span> — Body-text typography with size, weight, colour, and style modifiers."
msgstr "`.instui-text` · <span class=\"instui-pill -color-success pantoken-doc-tag\">stable</span> — Kroppstekst-typografi med storleik, vekt, farge og stil-modifikatorar."

#: css/text.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The `-variant-*` presets and the `-color-*`/`-size-*`/`-weight-*` modifiers all compose on the same element; unlike `heading`, it renders no implicit semantic level."
msgstr "`-variant-*`-forval og modifikatorane `-color-*`/`-size-*`/`-weight-*` kan alle brukast på same element; i motsetnad til `heading` gir det ingen implisitt semantisk nivå."

#: css/text.md
