msgid "# Function: initInPlaceEdit()"
msgstr "# Funksjon: initInPlaceEdit()"

#: formats/interactions/src/functions/initInPlaceEdit.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Wire a contenteditable field for click-to-edit commit/revert behaviour.\nEnter commits, Escape reverts; blur also commits if the value changed.\nFires a bubbling `change` CustomEvent with `detail.value` on commit."
msgstr "Koble opp eit contenteditable-felt for klikk-for-å-endre commit/angre-oppførsel.\nTrykk Enter for å bekrefte, Escape for å angre; blur bekreftar òg dersom verdien vart endra.\nSendar ein boblande `change` CustomEvent med `detail.value` ved commit."

#: formats/interactions/src/functions/initInPlaceEdit.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "  CSS:  host = .instui-in-place-edit element (which IS contenteditable)\n  WC:   host = shadow .instui-in-place-edit span"
msgstr "  CSS:  host = .instui-in-place-edit element (som IS contenteditable)\n  WC:   host = shadow .instui-in-place-edit span"

#: formats/interactions/src/functions/initInPlaceEdit.md
#, no-c-format
