msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# Function: initProgressCircle()"
msgstr "# Funksjon: initProgressCircle()"

#: formats/interactions/src/functions/initProgressCircle.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Release a ProgressCircle's mount-animation modifier after its configured delay."
msgstr "Løyse ut ein ProgressCircle sin mount-animation-modifikator etter den konfigurerte forsinkelsen."

#: formats/interactions/src/functions/initProgressCircle.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The delay is an explicit millisecond option or the target's computed, unitless\n`--animation-delay` custom property. Missing, negative, and non-finite values become zero. Both the\ncanonical modifier and its deprecated typo alias are accepted and removed."
msgstr "Forsinkinga er eit eksplisitt millisekundval eller målobjektets utrekna, uten-eining `--animation-delay`-eigenskap. Manglande, negative og ikkje-finite verdiar blir sett til null. Både den kanoniske modifikatoren og den utdaterte skrivefeil-aliasen blir akseptert og fjerna."

#: formats/interactions/src/functions/initProgressCircle.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### target"
msgstr "### target"

#: formats/interactions/src/functions/initRemove.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# Function: initRemove()"
msgstr "# Funksjon: initRemove()"

#: formats/interactions/src/functions/initRemove.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Remove a target after a timeout. Before removal, fires a cancelable, bubbling `dismiss` event.\nPreventing that event keeps the target mounted."
msgstr "Fjern eit mål etter ein tidsavgrensing. Før fjerning utløyser den eit avbrytbart, boblande `dismiss`-hending.\nÅ hindre den hendinga held målet montert."

#: formats/interactions/src/functions/initRemove.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The timeout is an explicit millisecond option or the target's computed, unitless `--timeout` CSS\ncustom property. Missing, non-finite, and non-positive values don't arm a timer. A fade uses the\n`@pantoken/components` `transition` utility's classes (`.instui-transition` + `-fade-*`), then waits\nfor `transitionend` (with a fallback); `transition: \"none\"` removes immediately."
msgstr "Tidsavgrensinga er ein eksplisitt millisekund‑innstilling eller målobjektet sin utrekna, einheitslause `--timeout` CSS\neigenskap. Manglande, ikkje-finite og ikkje-positive verdiar startar ikkje ein timer. Ein fading brukar\nklassane frå `@pantoken/components` `transition`-hjelpeverket (`.instui-transition` + `-fade-*`), og ventar deretter\npå `transitionend` (med ein fallback); `transition: \"none\"` fjernar umiddelbart."

#: formats/interactions/src/functions/initResponsiveOverlay.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# Function: initResponsiveOverlay()"
msgstr "# Funksjon: initResponsiveOverlay()"

#: formats/interactions/src/functions/initResponsiveOverlay.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Wire open/close commands plus width-based responsive overlay switching onto a host: any\ncollapsible side panel (e.g. a drawer's tray) can import this interaction rather than each\ncomponent reimplementing it."
msgstr "Koble opne/lukke-kommandar pluss breiddsbasert responsiv overlegg-veksling til ein vert: ethvert\nsamanfellbart sidepanel (t.d. eit skuffebrett) kan importere denne interaksjonen i staden for at kvar\nkomponent implementerer han på nytt."

#: formats/interactions/src/functions/initTooltip.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# Function: initTooltip()"
msgstr "# Funksjon: initTooltip()"

#: formats/interactions/src/functions/initTooltip.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Wire hover/focus show-hide with delay onto a tooltip wrapper and its tip\nbubble. Returns a cleanup function for use in web component disconnectedCallback."
msgstr "Koplar hover/focus vis-skjul med forsinkelse til eit tooltip-omslag og tip-bobla.\nReturnerer ein oppryddingsfunksjon for bruk i webkomponentens disconnectedCallback."

#: formats/interactions/src/functions/initTooltip.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "  CSS:  wrapper = .instui-tooltip element, tip = its .tip child\n  WC:   wrapper = shadow .instui-tooltip, tip = shadow .tip"
msgstr "  CSS:  wrapper = .instui-tooltip element, tip = dets .tip-barn\n  WC:   wrapper = shadow .instui-tooltip, tip = shadow .tip"

#: formats/interactions/src/functions/initTooltip.md
#, no-c-format
