#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# Interface: CommandEventish"
msgstr "# Grensesnitt: CommandEventish"

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The `command`/`source` shape of an Invoker Commands `CommandEvent` (not yet in DOM lib types)."
msgstr "Den `command`/`source` forma til ein Invoker Commands `CommandEvent` (ikkje i DOM-lib-typar enno)."

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### command"
msgstr "### command"

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### source"
msgstr "### source"

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### bubbles"
msgstr "### bubbles"

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The **`bubbles`** read-only property of the Event interface indicates whether the event bubbles up through the DOM tree or not."
msgstr "Den **`bubbles`** skrivebeskytta eigenskapen på Event-grensesnittet viser om hendinga boblar opp gjennom DOM-treet eller ikkje."

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### ~~cancelBubble~~"
msgstr "### ~~cancelBubble~~"

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The **`cancelBubble`** property of the Event interface is deprecated. Use Event.stopPropagation() instead. Setting its value to true before returning from an event handler prevents propagation of the event. In later implementations, setting this to false does nothing. See Browser compatibility for details."
msgstr "Eigenskapen **`cancelBubble`** på Event-grensesnittet er avvikla. Bruk Event.stopPropagation() i staden. Å sette verdien til true før ein returnerer frå ein hendinghandterar forhindrar at hendinga blir propagert. I seinare implementasjonar gjer det ingen ting å sette dette til false. Sjå nettlesarkompatibilitet for detaljar."

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "#### Deprecated"
msgstr "#### Utdatert"

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### cancelable"
msgstr "### cancelable"

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The **`cancelable`** read-only property of the Event interface indicates whether the event can be canceled, and therefore prevented as if the event never happened."
msgstr "Den **`cancelable`** skrivebeskytta eigenskapen på Event-grensesnittet indikerer om hendinga kan avbrytast, og dermed forhindrast som om hendinga aldri skjedde."

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### composed"
msgstr "### composed"

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The read-only **`composed`** property of the Event interface returns a boolean value which indicates whether or not the event will propagate across the shadow DOM boundary into the standard DOM."
msgstr "Den skrivebeskytta **`composed`** eigenskapen på Event-grensesnittet returnerer ein boolsk verdi som indikerer om hendinga vil propagere over grensene til shadow DOM inn i det vanlege DOM eller ikkje."

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### currentTarget"
msgstr "### currentTarget"

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The **`currentTarget`** read-only property of the Event interface identifies the element to which the event handler has been attached."
msgstr "Den **`currentTarget`** skrivebeskytta eigenskapen på Event-grensesnittet identifiserer elementet som hendinghandteraren blei festa til."

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### defaultPrevented"
msgstr "### defaultPrevented"

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The **`defaultPrevented`** read-only property of the Event interface returns a boolean value indicating whether or not the call to Event.preventDefault() canceled the event."
msgstr "Den **`defaultPrevented`** skrivebeskytta eigenskapen på Event-grensesnittet returnerer ein boolsk verdi som viser om kall til Event.preventDefault() avbraut hendinga."

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### eventPhase"
msgstr "### eventPhase"

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The **`eventPhase`** read-only property of the Event interface indicates which phase of the event flow is currently being evaluated."
msgstr "Den **`eventPhase`** skrivebeskytta eigenskapen på Event-grensesnittet indikerer kva fase av hendingstraumen som er under evaluering for augeblinken."

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### isTrusted"
msgstr "### isTrusted"

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The **`isTrusted`** read-only property of the Event interface is a boolean value that is true when the event was generated by the user agent (including via user actions and programmatic methods such as HTMLElement.focus()), and false when the event was dispatched via EventTarget.dispatchEvent(). The only exception is the click event, which initializes the isTrusted property to false in user agents."
msgstr "Den **`isTrusted`** skrivebeskytta eigenskapen på Event-grensesnittet er ein boolsk verdi som er true når hendinga vart generert av brukaragenten (inkludert via brukarhandlingar og programatiske metodar som HTMLElement.focus()), og false når hendinga vart sendt via EventTarget.dispatchEvent(). Eit unntak er click-hendinga, som set isTrusted til false i nokre brukaragentar."

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### ~~returnValue~~"
msgstr "### ~~returnValue~~"

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The Event property **`returnValue`** indicates whether the default action for this event has been prevented or not."
msgstr "Event-eigenskapen **`returnValue`** indikerer om standardhandlingen for denne hendinga er blitt forhindra eller ikkje."

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### ~~srcElement~~"
msgstr "### ~~srcElement~~"

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The deprecated **`Event.srcElement`** is an alias for the Event.target property. Use Event.target instead."
msgstr "Den avvikla **`Event.srcElement`** er eit alias for Event.target-eigenskapen. Bruk Event.target i staden."

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The read-only **`target`** property of the Event interface is a reference to the object onto which the event was dispatched. It is different from Event.currentTarget when the event handler is called during the bubbling or capturing phase of the event."
msgstr "Den skrivebeskytta **`target`** eigenskapen på Event-grensesnittet er ei referanse til objektet hendinga vart dispatcha på. Ho er ulik Event.currentTarget når hendinghandteraren kallar under bobling- eller fangefasen av hendinga."

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### timeStamp"
msgstr "### timeStamp"

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The **`timeStamp`** read-only property of the Event interface returns the time (in milliseconds) at which the event was created."
msgstr "Den **`timeStamp`** skrivebeskytta eigenskapen på Event-grensesnittet returnerer tida (i millisekund) då hendinga vart oppretta."

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The **`type`** read-only property of the Event interface returns a string containing the event's type. It is set when the event is constructed and is the name commonly used to refer to the specific event, such as click, load, or error."
msgstr "Den **`type`** skrivebeskytta eigenskapen på Event-grensesnittet returnerer ein streng med typen til hendinga. Ho blir sett ved konstruksjon av hendinga og er namnet som vanlegvis blir brukt for å vise til den spesifikke hendinga, som click, load eller error."

