#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### AT\\_TARGET"
msgstr "### AT\\_TARGET"

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### BUBBLING\\_PHASE"
msgstr "### BUBBLING\\_PHASE"

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### composedPath()"
msgstr "### composedPath()"

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The **`composedPath()`** method of the Event interface returns the event's path which is an array of the objects on which listeners will be invoked. This does not include nodes in shadow trees if the shadow root was created with its ShadowRoot.mode closed."
msgstr "Metoden **`composedPath()`** på Event-grensesnittet returnerer hendingas sti, som er eit array av objekt som lyttarar blir kalla på. Dette inkluderer ikkje nodar i shadow-tre dersom shadow root vart oppretta med ShadowRoot.mode sett til closed."

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### ~~initEvent()~~"
msgstr "### ~~initEvent()~~"

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The **`Event.initEvent()`** method is used to initialize the value of an event created using Document.createEvent()."
msgstr "Metoden **`Event.initEvent()`** blir brukt for å initialisere verdien til ein hending oppretta med Document.createEvent()."

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "##### type"
msgstr "##### type"

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "##### bubbles?"
msgstr "##### bubbles?"

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
