#: plugins/pantoken/colors/src/functions/onColor.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# Function: onColor()"
msgstr "# Funksjon: onColor()"

#: plugins/pantoken/colors/src/functions/onColor.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The readable foreground — black or white — for content placed *on* `surface`. This is the CSS-only\nform of InstUI's recurring `*-on-color` variants (a focus ring on a brand button, a\nprimary-inverse button's text, an icon on a coloured surface): rather than a fixed inverse token,\nit picks the contrast from the surface itself, so it stays correct as the surface changes."
msgstr "Den lesbare forgrunnen — svart eller kvit — for innhald plassert *på* `surface`. Dette er CSS-only-forma av InstUI sine gjentakande `*-on-color`-variantar (ein fokusring på ein merke-knapp, teksten til ein primary-inverse-knapp, eit ikon på ei farga flate): i staden for ein fast inverse-token, vel han kontrasten frå sjølve flata, så han held seg korrekt når flata endrar seg."

#: plugins/pantoken/colors/src/functions/onColor.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "It reads the surface's OKLCH lightness through relative color syntax and snaps it to `0` (black) or\n`1` (white) at `threshold` using the `calc(… * infinity)` clamp trick — no JS, no fixed hex."
msgstr "Han leser flata si OKLCH-lysstyrke via relativ fargesyntaks og snappar han til `0` (svart) eller `1` (kvit) ved `threshold` ved hjelp av `calc(… * infinity)` clamp-trikset — ingen JS, ingen faste hex."

#: plugins/pantoken/colors/src/functions/onColor.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### surface"
msgstr "### surface"

#: plugins/pantoken/colors/src/functions/onColor.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The background colour content sits on (literal, `var(--token)`, or a nested helper)."
msgstr "Bakgrunnsfargen innhaldet ligg på (literal, `var(--token)`, eller ein nestet helper)."

#: plugins/pantoken/colors/src/functions/onColor.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### threshold?"
msgstr "### threshold?"

#: plugins/pantoken/colors/src/functions/onColor.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "OKLCH lightness (0–1) above which the surface counts as \"light\" (default `0.62`)."
msgstr "OKLCH-lysstyrke (0–1) over kva flata tel som «lys» (standard `0.62`)."

#: plugins/pantoken/colors/src/functions/onColor.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
