msgid "Options for the [visualDebug](../functions/visualDebug.md) plugin."
msgstr "Alternativ for [visualDebug](../functions/visualDebug.md)-pluginen."

#: plugins/pantoken/visual-debug/src/interfaces/VisualDebugOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The debug outline colour (default: a bright magenta via `--pantoken-visual-debug-color`)."
msgstr "Fargen på feilsøkingskonturen (standard: ein klar magenta via `--pantoken-visual-debug-color`)."

#: plugins/pantoken/visual-debug/src/variables/VISUAL_DEBUG_RULES.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# Variable: VISUAL\\_DEBUG\\_RULES"
msgstr "# Variabel: VISUAL\\_DEBUG\\_RULES"

#: plugins/pantoken/visual-debug/src/variables/VISUAL_DEBUG_RULES.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The `-with-visual-debug` rules at the default outline colour, for the standalone `visual-debug.css` sheet."
msgstr "Reglane for `-with-visual-debug` ved standard omrissfarge, for det frittståande `visual-debug.css`-arket."

#: plugins/postcss/flatten-property/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# flatten-property"
msgstr "# flatten-property"

#: plugins/postcss/flatten-property/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@pantoken/plugin-flatten-property` — convert `@property` at-rules to plain custom-property\ndeclarations."
msgstr "`@pantoken/plugin-flatten-property` — konverter `@property` at-reglar til vanlege custom-property-deklarasjonar."

#: plugins/postcss/flatten-property/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@property` at-rules register typed CSS custom properties with `syntax`, `inherits`, and\n`initial-value` descriptors. They carry significant byte overhead — ~60 bytes of boilerplate per\nproperty — and are unnecessary when the stylesheet is a self-contained bundle where type\nregistration provides no runtime benefit. This plugin replaces each `@property` block with a\nsimple `--name: value` declaration inside a chosen selector, recovering all that overhead."
msgstr "`@property` at-reglar registrerer typa CSS custom properties med `syntax`, `inherits`, og\n`initial-value`-descriptorar. Dei fører med seg eit betydeleg byte-overhead — om lag 60 byte med boilerplate per\nproperty — og er unødvendige når stilarket er eit sjølvstendig bundle der typeregistrering ikkje gir nokon kjøretidsfordel. Denne pluginen erstattar kvar `@property` blokk med ei\nenkel `--name: value` deklarasjon innanfor ein vald selektor, og tek bort heile det overheadet."

#: plugins/postcss/flatten-property/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Semantic note:** removing `@property` loses CSS type registration. Typed transitions/animations,\n`@starting-style`, and the CSS Typed OM depend on it. Only apply to bundles where those semantics\nare not needed."
msgstr "**Semantisk merknad:** fjerning av `@property` fjernar CSS-typeregistrering. Typa overgangar/animasyonar,\n`@starting-style`, og CSS Typed OM er avhengige av dette. Bruk berre på bundle som ikkje treng desse semantikkane."

#: plugins/postcss/flatten-property/src/interfaces/FlattenPropertyOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# Interface: FlattenPropertyOptions"
msgstr "# Grensesnitt: FlattenPropertyOptions"

#: plugins/postcss/flatten-property/src/interfaces/FlattenPropertyOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Options for [flattenProperty](../variables/flattenProperty.md)."
msgstr "Val for [flattenProperty](../variables/flattenProperty.md)."

#: plugins/postcss/flatten-property/src/interfaces/FlattenPropertyOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### injectSelector?"
msgstr "### injectSelector?"

#: plugins/postcss/flatten-property/src/interfaces/FlattenPropertyOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The selector of the rule that receives the extracted `--name: value` declarations."
msgstr "Selektoren til regelen som mottek dei utdragne `--name: value`-deklarasjonane."

#: plugins/postcss/flatten-property/src/interfaces/FlattenPropertyOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "#### Default Value"
msgstr "#### Standardverdi"

#: plugins/postcss/flatten-property/src/interfaces/FlattenPropertyOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### onMissingInitialValue?"
msgstr "### onMissingInitialValue?"

#: plugins/postcss/flatten-property/src/interfaces/FlattenPropertyOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "What to do with an `@property` at-rule that has no `initial-value` descriptor."
msgstr "Kva som skal gjerast med ein `@property` at-regel som ikkje har ein `initial-value` beskrivar."

#: plugins/postcss/flatten-property/src/interfaces/FlattenPropertyOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- `\"remove\"` — drop the at-rule (default).\n- `\"keep\"` — leave it in the output untouched."
msgstr "- `\"remove\"` — dropp at-regelen (standard).\n- `\"keep\"` — lat at-regelen vere urørt i utdata."

#: plugins/postcss/flatten-property/src/variables/flattenProperty.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# Variable: flattenProperty"
msgstr "# Variabel: flattenProperty"

#: plugins/postcss/flatten-property/src/variables/flattenProperty.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Create the flatten-`@property` PostCSS plugin."
msgstr "Lag flatten-`@property` PostCSS-pluginen."

#: plugins/postcss/flatten-property/src/variables/flattenProperty.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Walks all `@property` at-rules in the stylesheet, extracts each `initial-value` descriptor, removes\nthe at-rule, and prepends a single `injectSelector { --name: value; … }` rule containing all\nextracted declarations. Empty rules and `@layer` blocks left behind after removal are dropped."
msgstr "Går gjennom alle `@property` at-reglar i stilarket, trekker ut kvar `initial-value`‑beskrivelse, fjernar at-regelen og legg føre ei einskild `injectSelector { --name: value; … }`‑regel som inneheld alle utdragne deklarasjonar. Tomme reglar og `@layer`‑blokker som blir liggande att etter fjerning blir sletta."

#: plugins/postcss/flatten-property/src/variables/flattenProperty.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Default injection into :root**"
msgstr "**Standard injeksjon i :root**"

#: plugins/postcss/flatten-property/src/variables/flattenProperty.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Inject into :scope (for use inside scope blocks)**"
msgstr "**Injiser i :scope (for bruk inne i scope-blokker)**"

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# mangle-custom-props"
msgstr "# mangle-custom-props"

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@pantoken/plugin-mangle-custom-props` — rename long custom property names to minimal sequential\nidentifiers."
msgstr "`@pantoken/plugin-mangle-custom-props` — endre lange eigendefinerte property-namn til minimale, sekvensielle\nidentifikatorar."

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Token names like `--instui-component-alert-border-top-style` are human-readable but expensive in\nminified bundles: the name itself is 40+ bytes, repeated in the definition, every `var()` call,\nand every `@property` registration. This plugin replaces every matching name — across definitions,\n`var()` references, and `@property` params — with a minimal identifier (`--a`, `--b`, …, `--aa`,\n…), cutting name overhead by ~90%."
msgstr "Token-namn som `--instui-component-alert-border-top-style` er menneske-leselege, men dyre i\nminifierte pakker: namnet sjølv er 40+ byte, gjenteke i definisjonen, i kvar `var()`-kall,\nog i kvar `@property`-registrering. Denne pluginen erstattar kvar samsvarande namn — på tvers av definisjonar,\n`var()`-referansar, og `@property`-parametrar — med ein minimal identifikator (`--a`, `--b`, …, `--aa`,\n…), og reduserer namn-overhead med om lag 90 %."

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Names are collected from the full stylesheet, sorted alphabetically for a deterministic mapping,\nthen assigned sequentially. A [MangleCustomPropsOptions.sharedManifest](interfaces/MangleCustomPropsOptions.md#sharedmanifest) option lets multiple\nseparate PostCSS passes share one consistent mapping, so separately processed CSS files that will\nbe loaded together can safely be mangled with the same names."
msgstr "Namn blir samla frå heile stylesheetet, sorterte alfabetisk for å få ei deterministisk kartlegging,\nog deretter tildelte sekvensielt. Ei [MangleCustomPropsOptions.sharedManifest](interfaces/MangleCustomPropsOptions.md#sharedmanifest)-opsjon lar fleire\nseparate PostCSS-pass dele ei einsarta kartlegging, slik at CSS-filer prosessert separat som skal\nlastast saman trygt kan mangleast med dei same namna."

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/interfaces/MangleCustomPropsOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# Interface: MangleCustomPropsOptions"
msgstr "# Grensesnitt: MangleCustomPropsOptions"

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/interfaces/MangleCustomPropsOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Options for [mangleCustomProps](../variables/mangleCustomProps.md)."
msgstr "Val for [mangleCustomProps](../variables/mangleCustomProps.md)."

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/interfaces/MangleCustomPropsOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Only custom property names that start with this string are mangled."
msgstr "Berre eigenskapnamn for tilpassa eigenskapar som byrjar med denne strengen blir mangla."

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/interfaces/MangleCustomPropsOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### method?"
msgstr "### method?"

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/interfaces/MangleCustomPropsOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The algorithm used to generate short replacement names."
msgstr "Algoritmen som blir brukt for å generere korte erstatningsnamn."

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/interfaces/MangleCustomPropsOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- `\"base26\"` — `--a`, `--b`, …, `--z`, `--aa`, `--ab`, … (default; shortest for large sets)\n- `\"base36\"` — `--0`, `--1`, …, `--9`, `--a`, …, `--z`, `--10`, … (alphanumeric)\n- `\"numeric\"` — `--0`, `--1`, `--2`, …"
msgstr "- `\"base26\"` — `--a`, `--b`, …, `--z`, `--aa`, `--ab`, … (standard; kortast for store sett)\n- `\"base36\"` — `--0`, `--1`, …, `--9`, `--a`, …, `--z`, `--10`, … (alfa-numerisk)\n- `\"numeric\"` — `--0`, `--1`, `--2`, …"

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/interfaces/MangleCustomPropsOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### propertyMap?"
msgstr "### propertyMap?"

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/interfaces/MangleCustomPropsOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "When `true`, appends a `mangle-map` entry to PostCSS `result.messages` after processing.\nThe message has shape `{ type: \"mangle-map\", plugin: \"pantoken-mangle-custom-props\", map: Map<string, string> }`."
msgstr "Når `true`, legg til ein `mangle-map`-oppføring i PostCSS `result.messages` etter behandling.\nMeldinga har forma `{ type: \"mangle-map\", plugin: \"pantoken-mangle-custom-props\", map: Map<string, string> }`."

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/interfaces/MangleCustomPropsOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### sharedManifest?"
msgstr "### sharedManifest?"

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/interfaces/MangleCustomPropsOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A mutable `Map` shared across multiple PostCSS passes."
msgstr "Ein muterbar `Map` delt mellom fleire PostCSS-pass."

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/interfaces/MangleCustomPropsOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "On each pass the plugin reads existing entries (reusing their short names) and writes new\nones (continuing the counter from `sharedManifest.size`). Pass the same `Map` instance to\nevery `mangleCustomProps` or `applyMinify` call that processes CSS files which will be\nloaded together in the browser — this guarantees all files use an identical name mapping."
msgstr "Ved kvart pass les plugin-en eksisterande oppføringar (gjenbrukar deira korte namn) og skriv nye\n(held tellaren vidare frå `sharedManifest.size`). Pass same `Map`-instans til\nkvar `mangleCustomProps` eller `applyMinify`-kall som behandlar CSS-filer som skal\nlastast saman i nettlesaren — dette garanterer at alle filene bruker eitt og same namnark."

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/interfaces/MangleCustomPropsOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Process the token sheet first so its names are seeded into the manifest before the component\nsheets add their (typically overlapping) references."
msgstr "Behandle token-arket først slik at namna frå det blir frøa inn i manifestet før komponentarkene\nlegg til sine (vanlegvis overlappande) referansar."

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/type-aliases/MangleMethod.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# Type Alias: MangleMethod"
msgstr "# Typealias: MangleMethod"

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/type-aliases/MangleMethod.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Short-name generation strategy for [mangleCustomProps](../variables/mangleCustomProps.md)."
msgstr "Strategi for generering av kortnamn for [mangleCustomProps](../variables/mangleCustomProps.md)."

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/variables/mangleCustomProps.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# Variable: mangleCustomProps"
msgstr "# Variabel: mangleCustomProps"

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/variables/mangleCustomProps.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Create the mangle-custom-properties PostCSS plugin."
msgstr "Lag PostCSS-pluggen mangle-custom-properties."

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/variables/mangleCustomProps.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Collects all custom property names matching `prefix` from declaration props, `var()` references,\nand `@property` params. Sorts them alphabetically for a stable, deterministic mapping, then\nassigns short names using the chosen `method`. Replaces every occurrence throughout the stylesheet."
msgstr "Samlar alle eigne eigenskapnamn som samsvarar med `prefix` frå deklarasjons-props, `var()`-referansar,\nog `@property`-parametrar. Sorterer dei alfabetisk for ei stabil, deterministisk kartlegging, og tildeler deretter korte namn med den valde `method`. Erstattar kvar førekome i heile stilarket."

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/variables/mangleCustomProps.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Mangle with defaults (--instui-\\*, base26)**"
msgstr "**Mangle med standardinnstillingar (--instui-\\\\*, base26)**"

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/variables/mangleCustomProps.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Share the mapping across two files loaded together**"
msgstr "**Del kartlegginga mellom to filer som blir lasta inn saman**"

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/variables/mangleCustomProps.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Use base36 names and emit the mapping via result.messages**"
msgstr "**Bruk base36-namn og send ut kartlegginga via result.messages**"

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/functions/applyMinify.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# Function: applyMinify()"
msgstr "# Funksjon: applyMinify()"

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/functions/applyMinify.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Apply custom-property minification transforms to a stylesheet string."
msgstr "Bruk minifiseringstransformasjonar for custom properties på ein stylesheet-streng."

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/functions/applyMinify.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Builds a PostCSS plugin array from `options` and runs it synchronously. Plugin order:\n`pruneCustomProps` → `flattenProperty` → `mangleCustomProps`. Returns the input unchanged when\nno options are set."
msgstr "Byggjer eit PostCSS-plugin-array frå `options` og køyrer det synkront. Plugin-rekkefølgje:\n`pruneCustomProps` → `flattenProperty` → `mangleCustomProps`. Returnerer input uendra når\ningen alternativ er sett."

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/functions/applyMinify.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The stylesheet string to transform."
msgstr "Stylesheet-strengen som skal transformast."

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/functions/applyMinify.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The transformed CSS string."
msgstr "Den transformerte CSS-strengen."

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# props-minify"
msgstr "# props-minify"

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@pantoken/plugin-props-minify` — compose prune, flatten, and mangle transforms for\n`--instui-*` custom properties via a single [applyMinify](functions/applyMinify.md) utility."
msgstr "`@pantoken/plugin-props-minify` — sette saman prune-, flatten- og mangle-transformasjonar for\n`--instui-*` eigenskapar via eit enkelt [applyMinify](functions/applyMinify.md)-hjelpeverktøy."

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Each CSS-emitting pipeline (generate scripts, renderers) uses `applyMinify` for a consistent\nminification surface without taking a direct PostCSS dependency."
msgstr "Kvar CSS-utgjevings-pipeline (generate scripts, renderers) brukar `applyMinify` for ein konsekvent\nminifieringsflate utan å ta ein direkte PostCSS-avhengigheit."

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Prune + mangle are only safe for self-contained bundles** where all `var(--instui-*)` references\nand their definitions live in the same output. For separate-file consumers (`@pantoken/css` +\n`@pantoken/components` loaded independently), apply `{ flatten: true }` only."
msgstr "**Prune + mangle er berre trygt for sjølvstendige bundlar** der alle `var(--instui-*)`-referansar\nog deira definisjonar finst i same utdata. For forbrukarar med separate filer (`@pantoken/css` +\n`@pantoken/components` lasta uavhengig), bruk berre `{ flatten: true }`."

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Mangle across file boundaries:** pass the same `Map` instance as\n`mangle.sharedManifest` to every `applyMinify` call that processes CSS files loaded together.\nProcess the token sheet first (it seeds the manifest), then component sheets."
msgstr "**Mangle på tvers av filgrenser:** pass same `Map`-instans som\n`mangle.sharedManifest` til kvar `applyMinify`-kall som prosesserer CSS-filer lasta saman.\nBehandle token-arket fyrst (det frøkker manifestet), deretter komponentark."

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Apply all three transforms to a self-contained bundle**"
msgstr "**Bruk alle tre transformasjonane på ein sjølvstendig pakke**"

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Flatten only (safe for separate-file consumers)**"
msgstr "**Berre flatten (trygt for forbrukarar av separate filer)**"

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Mangle two files with the same mapping**"
msgstr "**Mangle to filer med same mapping**"

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/interfaces/PropsMinifyOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# Interface: PropsMinifyOptions"
msgstr "# Grensesnitt: PropsMinifyOptions"

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/interfaces/PropsMinifyOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Options for [applyMinify](../functions/applyMinify.md)."
msgstr "Val for [applyMinify](../functions/applyMinify.md)."

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/interfaces/PropsMinifyOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### prune?"
msgstr "### prune?"

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/interfaces/PropsMinifyOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Apply [pruneCustomProps](../variables/pruneCustomProps.md) to tree-shake unused `--instui-*` tokens before other transforms."
msgstr "Bruk [pruneCustomProps](../variables/pruneCustomProps.md) for å tree-shake bort ubrukte `--instui-*`-tokenar før andre transformasjonar."

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/interfaces/PropsMinifyOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Only safe for self-contained bundles that contain both token definitions and the component\nrules that reference them. Pruning a token-only sheet removes everything."
msgstr "Trygt berre for sjølvstendige pakkar som inneheld både token-definisjonar og komponent\nreglar som refererer til dei. Å fjerne eit stilark som berre inneheld tokenar fjernar alt."

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/interfaces/PropsMinifyOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### flatten?"
msgstr "### flatten?"

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/interfaces/PropsMinifyOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Apply [flattenProperty](../variables/flattenProperty.md) to convert `@property` at-rules to plain declarations."
msgstr "Bruk [flattenProperty](../variables/flattenProperty.md) for å konvertere `@property` at-reglar til enkle deklarasjonar."

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/interfaces/PropsMinifyOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`true` uses plugin defaults (`injectSelector: \":root\"`, `onMissingInitialValue: \"remove\"`).\nPass a [FlattenPropertyOptions](FlattenPropertyOptions.md) object to override individual defaults."
msgstr "`true` nyttar plugin-standardar (`injectSelector: \":root\"`, `onMissingInitialValue: \"remove\"`).\nGje eit [FlattenPropertyOptions](FlattenPropertyOptions.md)-objekt for å overstyre dei enkelte standardane."

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/interfaces/PropsMinifyOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### mangle?"
msgstr "### mangle?"

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/interfaces/PropsMinifyOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Apply [mangleCustomProps](../variables/mangleCustomProps.md) to replace long `--instui-*` names with minimal identifiers."
msgstr "Bruk [mangleCustomProps](../variables/mangleCustomProps.md) for å erstatte lange `--instui-*`-namn med minimale identifikatorar."

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/interfaces/PropsMinifyOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`true` uses plugin defaults (`prefix: \"--instui-\"`, `method: \"base26\"`).\nPass a [MangleCustomPropsOptions](MangleCustomPropsOptions.md) object to override individual defaults — including\n`sharedManifest` for cross-file coordination."
msgstr "`true` nyttar plugin-standardar (`prefix: \"--instui-\"`, `method: \"base26\"`).\nGje eit [MangleCustomPropsOptions](MangleCustomPropsOptions.md)-objekt for å overstyre dei enkelte standardane — inkludert\n`sharedManifest` for koordinering på tvers av filer."

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/interfaces/PropsMinifyOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Only safe for self-contained bundles. See module-level docs."
msgstr "Trygt berre for sjølvstendige pakkar. Sjå dokumentasjonen på modulnivå."

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/variables/pruneCustomProps.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# Variable: pruneCustomProps"
msgstr "# Variabel: pruneCustomProps"

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/variables/pruneCustomProps.md
