msgid "`@pantoken/foundation` — theme Foundation for Sites with Instructure tokens."
msgstr "`@pantoken/foundation` — tema Foundation for Sites med Instructure-tokenar."

#: renderers/foundation/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Foundation is Sass-first, so this package ships two layers. [toFoundationSettings](functions/toFoundationSettings.md) emits a\n`_settings`-style Sass partial that points Foundation's setting variables at `var(--instui-*)`, so\na Sass build compiles the Instructure look while keeping runtime theming through the same custom\nproperties. [toFoundationCss](functions/toFoundationCss.md) emits a thin CSS overlay that themes the common compiled\nclasses (`.button`, `.callout`, links) the same way — useful when you consume stock Foundation CSS\nand just want to layer Instructure colors on top without recompiling."
msgstr "Foundation er Sass-først, så denne pakken leverer to lag. [toFoundationSettings](functions/toFoundationSettings.md) genererer ein\n`_settings`-style Sass-partial som peikar Foundation sine innstillingsvariablar mot `var(--instui-*)`, slik at\neit Sass-bygge kompilerer Instructure-utseendet samtidig som det held på kjøretidstema gjennom dei same eigenskapane. [toFoundationCss](functions/toFoundationCss.md) genererer eit tynt CSS-omslag som tematiserer dei vanlege kompilerte\nklassane (`.button`, `.callout`, lenker) på same måte — nyttig når du nyttar standard Foundation CSS\nog berre vil leggje Instructure-fargar ovanpå utan å kompilere på nytt."

