#: renderers/pendo/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# pendo"
msgstr "# pendo"

#: renderers/pendo/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@pantoken/pendo` — an Instructure-styled global stylesheet for Pendo guides."
msgstr "`@pantoken/pendo` — eit Instructure-styla, globalt stilark for Pendo-rettleiingar."

#: renderers/pendo/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Pendo injects guide HTML into a host page; this renders that guide DOM (`._pendo-*`) to match\nInstructure UI, using pantoken's `--instui-*` token layer for alignment. It includes responsive\nviolet and sea banner guide treatments alongside alerts, popovers, surveys, and controls. The\ncomponent CSS is ported from `@instructure/pendo-global-css`; pantoken supplies the tokens and the\nassembly. A single theme class containing `instui` activates the scoped stylesheet; compact\nsuffixes on that class select banner colors and glyphs."
msgstr "Pendo set inn guide‑HTML i ein vertsside; dette rendrar den guide‑DOMen (`._pendo-*`) for å samsvare med\nInstructure UI, ved å bruke pantoken sitt `--instui-*` token‑lag for justering. Det inneheld responsive\nlilla og sjø‑banner‑guidebehandlingar i tillegg til varsel, popovers, undersøkingar og kontrollar. Komponent‑CSS-en er portert frå `@instructure/pendo-global-css`; pantoken leverer tokena og\nsamansettinga. Éin tema‑klasse som inneheld `instui` aktiverer det avgrensa stilarket; kompakte\nsuffix på den klassen vel fargar og glyfar for banner."

#: renderers/pendo/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "[buildPendoCss](functions/buildPendoCss.md) composes the stylesheet; [pendoCss](variables/pendoCss.md) is the ready-made `rebrand` build\n(scoped, `!important`). A static file is published at `@pantoken/pendo/global.css`."
msgstr "[buildPendoCss](functions/buildPendoCss.md) set saman stilarket; [pendoCss](variables/pendoCss.md) er den ferdige `rebrand`‑bygginga\n(avgrensa, `!important`). Ein statisk fil blir publisert på `@pantoken/pendo/global.css`."

#: renderers/pendo/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Renames and re-exports [pendoCss](variables/pendoCss.md)"
msgstr "Endrar namn og re‑eksporterer [pendoCss](variables/pendoCss.md)"

